41509::$$$message_0306_0000_0000$$$::"Mitsuzuri Ayako's Personal Outfit (Left), [br]Kyudo outfit variations (Center), [br]and Issei Ryudou's Personal Outfit (Right), eh?"::
41510::$$$message_0306_0001_0000$$$::"It wouldn't look out of place at all if they traded clothes."::
41511::$$$message_0306_0002_0000$$$::"That could be interpreted as a compliment."::
41512::$$$message_0306_0003_0000$$$::"Then I take it back![lr]::
41513::$$$message_0306_0003_0001$$$::Clothes for slender people wouldn't look good at all on Ryudou, also his skin isn't pretty, [cacheimage storage=凛巫女服01i(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛巫女服01i(中)]all soft and smooth without a single blemish, grrr!"::
41514::$$$message_0306_0004_0000$$$::"Mitsuzuri's kyudo outfit always suits her so well..."::
41515::$$$message_0306_0005_0000$$$::"Yeah, [wvl canskip=0 time=400]it's good. [wvl canskip=0 time=400]Real good.[br][wvl canskip=0 time=400]There's also one bow-related Servant who may or may not look good in it? Oh come on, gimme a break."[wvs][move textoff=0 time=220 path=(107,136,255)(94,145,255)(64,160,0) storage=020_溜息 accel=-2 spline=1][wm canskip=0]::
41516::$$$message_0306_0006_0000$$$::"So it did bother you."::U/